                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "This class \"will be\" used for?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Should we have this `Listener` class as an interface, and then use it as a base class for `EventListener`, `FileListener`, etc.?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Why an interface?\n-> Do we need to decide instantiation at runtime? Also,\n-> I don't see a need where we need to mandate a common implementation by derived classes."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Agree, there is no mandate as such. This is a design suggestion. Many of the functionalities maybe common for `EventListener` and the planned `FileListener`, so we can have the common functionalities in a Base class."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't see any common functionality between File Listener with dbus (other) events.\neach type will have own style of processing the events."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "From design perspective, I don't see any mandatory implementation required by the derived class. So I don't find interface adding any value here.\nI am ok with the current implementation."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Why do we need this now?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "as we will handle dbus events in the listener, so added as part of stub."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/listener.hpp",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
